WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.407
We spend our days reading, building and talking, across dozens of tabs, docs and calls.

00:00:05.407 --> 00:00:09.927
Almost none of it adds up to a picture of who we are, or where we're heading.

00:00:10.827 --> 00:00:16.224
Magic is a private AI that records everything you do on your computer, on your own laptop.

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:18.923
Local models turn it into evidence about you:

00:00:18.923 --> 00:00:22.940
your skills, your habits, your personality, and the path you're on.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.044
This is the founder's real Magic, after three weeks.

00:00:27.044 --> 00:00:32.156
Twenty thousand moments, nearly a thousand ideas, and zero bytes sent to the cloud.

00:00:32.156 --> 00:00:33.881
Here's who it thinks she is.

00:00:34.781 --> 00:00:37.768
Every trait is placed from behaviour, not a quiz.

00:00:37.768 --> 00:00:42.522
Tap one, and Magic explains what it means, and the evidence from her own week.

00:00:43.422 --> 00:00:45.356
It names her blind spots, kindly.

00:00:45.356 --> 00:00:49.223
And it shows how deep her knowledge goes in each area of her life.

00:00:50.123 --> 00:00:51.652
Each area becomes a topic.

00:00:51.652 --> 00:00:58.062
In data engineering, Magic says she's proficient, and spells out exactly what an expert would do differently.

00:00:58.962 --> 00:01:00.791
Then it gives her a path forward.

00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:04.116
Each step says how to do it, and how she'll know she's done.

00:01:05.016 --> 00:01:10.256
Every idea she's touched sits on a map of the field, shaded by how deeply she knows it.

00:01:10.256 --> 00:01:13.267
Tap one, and see how she learned it, step by step.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:18.748
And it pairs her with mentors at every stage: people who have already walked the path.

00:01:19.648 --> 00:01:22.659
Today, Magic is a mirror for one person's growth.

00:01:22.659 --> 00:01:28.927
Next, it becomes the private context layer that every tool and AI agent can ask, with your permission:

00:01:28.927 --> 00:01:31.815
who is this person, and what do they need next?

00:01:32.715 --> 00:01:37.839
Magic. See how you grow. Step inside the live demo, and see it for yourself.
